usage: python3 benchmarks/tools/certora-venv/bin/certoraEqCheck def fileA:contractA:functionA:solcA fileB:contractB:functionB:solcB

A Certora tool for checking the equivalence of two pure Solidity functions.

positional arguments:
  {conf,def}
    conf      --conf <path to conf file> <contract>:<functionA>
              <contractB>:<functionB>
    def       <path to fileA>:<contractA>:<functionA>:<solcA> <path to
              fileB>:<contractB>:<functionB>:<solcB>

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
